    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Founded 2003 by Matt Rice (Creative Director) and Hege Aaby (Managing Director); a small London studio, currently ~3-4 people, operating out of the Bureau Design District in Greenwich. Over 20 years building digital products, apps, games and brand identities for clients including Google, Sky, Barclays, Nike, The Guardian, McKinsey and UNICEF; 50+ international design awards. Studio does both design and build (web/apps), plus motion design, branding, and their own game titles (Alphaputt, OLO Loco, Polyverse in development). Disciplined generalists who skew toward joyful digital product work. Work Status set as Studio.",
